Bundled libusb
================================================================================

Windows builds include libusb 1.0.30 (src/Panelith.Devices/Native/win-x64/
libusb-1.0.dll), unmodified from the official release at
https://github.com/libusb/libusb/releases. libusb is licensed under the GNU
Lesser General Public License, version 2.1, and is loaded dynamically; you may
replace the DLL with your own build. Source: https://github.com/libusb/libusb.

